{"id":"1c0193f30ac79f90","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-positive-fiber.md","title":"Omega 正测度纤维的左 c.e. 性与随机原像","display":"thm-omega-positive-fiber — Omega 正测度纤维的左 c.e. 性与随机原像","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-positive-fiber","aliases":["43-thm-omega-positive-fiber"],"display":"thm-omega-positive-fiber — Omega 正测度纤维的左 c.e. 性与随机原像","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-spectrum]]","[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemmas 18.5.2–18.5.3 and Proposition 18.5.4","source_printed_pages":"560–561","source_pdf_pages":"580–581","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-positive-fiber"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-positive-fiber</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-positive-fiber — Omega 正测度纤维的左 c.e. 性与随机原像"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2467644590e93018\" href=\"?note=2467644590e93018\" title=\"43-df-omega-spectrum\">43-df-omega-spectrum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemmas 18.5.2–18.5.3 and Proposition 18.5.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"560–561"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"580–581"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_U,F_U,\\operatorname{Spec}\">\\(m_U,F_U,\\operatorname{Spec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2467644590e93018\" href=\"?note=2467644590e93018\" title=\"43-df-omega-spectrum\">43-df-omega-spectrum</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}\">\\(\\operatorname{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(m_U(x)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{LeftComputable}(x)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(m_U(x)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{LeftComputable}(x)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(\\operatorname{LeftComputable}(x)\\Rightarrow\\left(m_U(x)&gt;0\\iff\\exists A\\in F_U(x)\\;\\operatorname{MLRandom}(A)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(\\operatorname{LeftComputable}(x)\\Rightarrow\\left(m_U(x)&gt;0\\iff\\exists A\\in F_U(x)\\;\\operatorname{MLRandom}(A)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec}(\\Omega_U)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Spec}(\\Omega_U)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二个等价必须保留 x 左 c.e. 的条件；任意实数的纤维包含一个随机 oracle 并不自动保证正测度。谱非空来自在随机有效闭类上取得左 c.e. 最小值的论证。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemmas 18.5.2–18.5.3 and Proposition 18.5.4，印刷页 560–561，PDF 页 580–581。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-spectrum","status":"resolved","id":"2467644590e93018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-spectrum]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-spectrum","status":"resolved","id":"2